{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "main_6_level_st_06-01",
  "groupId": "main_6",
  "stageId": "st_06-01",
  "title": "Leave it Behind",
  "storyCode": "6-6",
  "avgTag": "Interlude",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_st_06-01.txt",
  "sourceHash": "452c61fee14c6dba76adce258cf6e752ce8fc55231a8b0581539a41ae8afbcb7",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第六关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "Eno, what's this book about?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eno",
      "text": "Ah, I read it. So I brought it for you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eno",
      "text": "I think you'll like it, Sasha! It's a book about ideals.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sasha",
      "text": "Ideals?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eno",
      "text": "Yes.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sasha",
      "text": "What are your ideals, Eno?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eno",
      "text": "...Ideals, huh.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eno",
      "text": "I don't know. Can I have ideals?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sasha",
      "text": "Of course you can! Why couldn't you?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eno",
      "text": "Ah, crap, it's time to go home...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sasha",
      "text": "You don't want to go?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eno",
      "text": "...I don't want to go home.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sasha",
      "text": "But Eno, you said that if you didn't go home, your father would beat you...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sasha",
      "text": "But I'll see you tomorrow, right? I can still see you tomorrow.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eno",
      "text": "I know. I'll put the book and some bread in here.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eno",
      "text": "...Sasha, I don't want to go. It's terrible. I'll get beaten even if I go back now.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sasha",
      "text": "........",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sasha",
      "text": "So come out tomorrow. If you get hit, you can hit me.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eno",
      "text": "Huh...? Hahaha, Sasha, did you get in another fight? Did they knock your head around?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eno",
      "text": "You have bruises, so many wounds.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sasha",
      "text": "This way, people know you're hurting. At least someone will know.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eno",
      "text": "Well, I know what you're thinking. But I won't.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sasha",
      "text": "If those kids are still picking on you, let me know! I'll take them all down!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eno",
      "text": "I know!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eno",
      "text": "See you tomorrow! I'll come and sing to you again!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "I don't even know what happened to him.\nAll I know is that he gave me food.\nI only know that he could read, and I wanted to read, and he taught me.\nI only know that the other kids liked to bully him because he gave me bread and I was stronger, and I hit them and they hit me.\nBut I don't know what happened to him."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eno",
      "text": "I'm scared. Sasha, I'm really scared.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eno",
      "text": "I think.... I don't belong in that home. I overheard that my mom.... My mom isn't even in the house.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eno",
      "text": "The way they look at me, they're all terrifying, and I don't want to go back. I don't want to go back....",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sasha",
      "text": "But there's no food, or anywhere to stay here, it's just.... Just sewers.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eno",
      "text": "I don't care.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sasha",
      "text": "But....",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eno",
      "text": "........",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eno",
      "text": "Do you hate me too?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sasha",
      "text": "What...? Why?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eno",
      "text": "Because I like to laugh?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sasha",
      "text": "No.... No. Why would I?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eno",
      "text": "Because I shouldn't laugh.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sasha",
      "text": "Nonsense! Eno, you should keep laughing.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eno",
      "text": "Really?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sasha",
      "text": "Really.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Would things be different if he didn't go back that day?\nJust because I thought my place was too cold and dirty, I sent him home?\nIf he hadn't gone back, would it have changed everything?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sasha",
      "text": "You're hurt! The wound on your stomach.... What happened, what happened?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eno",
      "text": "Sasha.... I've been laughing.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eno",
      "text": "You see, you told me I could laugh, so I kept laughing.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eno",
      "text": "I never stopped laughing....",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eno",
      "text": "Sasha, do you still want to hear me sing?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "After that, he visited me from time to time.\nAnd each time he had more and more scars....\nSo many more.\nI realized how much the things I said influenced him. So I started talking less.\nWould that make things better?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sasha",
      "text": "Your back!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sasha",
      "text": "Your back....",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eno",
      "text": "........",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sasha",
      "text": "......Does it hurt?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eno",
      "text": "........",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sasha",
      "text": "This can't keep happening.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sasha",
      "text": "Who the hell did this?! Why are they doing this to you?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sasha",
      "text": "Whoever it is.... they need to be punished! Whatever it is, it needs to be destroyed!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sasha",
      "text": "Eno, take me with you!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eno",
      "text": "...All right.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sasha",
      "text": "Huh?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eno",
      "text": "I will.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "I didn't know what I'd said.\nI didn't know if I could say anything anymore.\nWhat did I do? What the hell did I do?\nI've read a lot of books too, but no book ever told me.\nNothing ever told me."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eno",
      "text": "Look. Look at it, Sasha...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eno",
      "text": "You told me you wanted to destroy everything that hurt me, didn't you?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sasha",
      "text": "........",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sasha",
      "text": "Come on.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sasha",
      "text": "Your wounds...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eno",
      "text": "They're not important. It doesn't matter.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eno",
      "text": "You see, with one little breath.... It's all better. It's all fine.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sasha",
      "text": "Come on, I'll bandage you up! There must be some cloth around here...!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eno",
      "text": "That man cut my leg.... Then with one breath, it's better.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eno",
      "text": "An old man slashed my back. One light touch, and it was fine.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eno",
      "text": "And it's all thanks to that Originium rock that fat woman shoved down my throat!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sasha",
      "text": "That's enough, Eno. Really...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eno",
      "text": "I can't sing anymore, but you see, it's all from the Originium!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eno",
      "text": "There's nothing I can't do!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sasha",
      "text": "Eno!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eno",
      "text": "...You're unhappy. Why? I only did what you told me.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eno",
      "text": "Why are you unhappy?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eno",
      "text": "Obviously they're all happy. Just do what they say and they'll all be happy....",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sasha",
      "text": "...Because all of your family are assholes. All of them.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eno",
      "text": "Yes!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eno",
      "text": "So the kids killed them.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sasha",
      "text": "...What?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eno",
      "text": "The Infected kids who hadn't been driven out of town....",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sasha",
      "text": "What did you do to them?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eno",
      "text": "They hit me, too. They hurt you too.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eno",
      "text": "Now, they are like pieces on a chess board. My literal pawns.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eno",
      "text": "As soon as I healed their wounds, they obeyed my every command.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eno",
      "text": "I'll take that bunch of ugly, disgusting people, all of them.... All of them!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eno",
      "text": "You see, Sasha? You see what I've done?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eno",
      "text": "We'll burn it down in one magnificent blaze! All of it!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sasha",
      "text": "........",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eno",
      "text": "Sasha, what's wrong with you?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sasha",
      "text": "Don't do anything like that ever again.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eno",
      "text": "But I thought you said....",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sasha",
      "text": "I didn't think it would turn out this way.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sasha",
      "text": "Eno, do what you really want to do. Not this.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sasha",
      "text": "I can help you. You don't have to do this.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eno",
      "text": "But I....",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sasha",
      "text": "That's enough! Just do what you truly want, Eno!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sasha",
      "text": "Not what you're forced to do. Not the bloodshed, not the heartbreak, not the revenge!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sasha",
      "text": "You don't even like this kind of thing...!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eno",
      "text": "...Sasha...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eno",
      "text": "I....",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eno",
      "text": "I want to.... Sing....",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eno",
      "text": "Ugh....",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sasha",
      "text": "........",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "I couldn't do anything.\nI was useless."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sasha",
      "text": "Eno....",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eno",
      "text": "I can't sing anymore.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sasha",
      "text": "We'll go together. We'll survive.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eno",
      "text": "Survive?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eno",
      "text": "What's so great about that?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sasha",
      "text": "........",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sasha",
      "text": "Nothing.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sasha",
      "text": "But we can do it together.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eno",
      "text": "What are you going to do?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sasha",
      "text": "This is the Originium I stole from the mine, I was going to sell it for some food.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eno",
      "text": "Sasha!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sasha",
      "text": "Mmm!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sasha",
      "text": "This way, we're both infected.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sasha",
      "text": "Let's survive together.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "Such things? I'm not interested.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "There is no reason for anything you do. There is no meaning to your life on this planet.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "No, you don't need anyone to save you...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "????",
      "text": "Pick a name you like.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "This one? Good.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "Mephisto...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "Mephisto. From now on, you are Mephisto. You are no longer what you were.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "I don't trust you. I have no right to trust you. The only person you can trust is yourself.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "What you did cannot be written off. You will always carry your past, even if you forget, even if you cannot understand what you did.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "Everything you do, everything you go through, will become your kindling. They compel you, to keep the fire burning within you....",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "Until the whole earth is free, until you throw away all that others have given you, until you finally understand yourself.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "At that point, you can even discard the name. It's your choice whether you stay or go, live or die.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "Mephisto, I can't change your ideals. If you don't have it, go find it. We'll help ourselves.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "Who am I? That's not important.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "What should you call me?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "......Talulah",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "text": "I'm a rebel, an ordinary woman. I'm nobody. But for now, you can call me Talulah",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "And Talulah didn't say much to me.\nShe held me tight and rapped three times on my back.\nTalulah trusted me. Yelena, Buldrokkas'tee, Lyudmila. They all believed in me.\nI thought I could put the childhood I spent in that city behind me.\nOnly, things changed quickly. It started with what happened in that village.\nIt was a tragedy. But why did that tragedy make her this way?\nWhy did things turn out like this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "text": "I'll do whatever you want me to do....",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "text": "No need. Do as you please.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "text": "I allow it. You are Mephisto, after all.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "text": "But, you said before....",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "text": "That was years ago.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "text": "It's only natural that some things change over the course of a career.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "text": "If we don't keep up with the times, we're doomed.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "text": "So we, and our fellow Infected, must fight for our collective future.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "text": "Anyone can be sacrificed for that ideal.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "text": "I can trust you, can't I?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "text": "Yes. Because I am Talulah.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "text": "Then I will!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "text": "You will, I'm sure you will.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "text": "We can't do it without you. You can do anything, and you can accomplish anything.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "text": "Come in.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "........",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "text": "You should have seen it all.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "Who are you?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "text": "I am Talulah, of course.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "The Talulah I knew... is not you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "text": "Talulah is just a name. Talulah is just Talulah",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "text": "Help him. Mephisto needs your help. Mephisto needs you to give him value. He trusts only you and me.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "Talulah would never do that. You're taking advantage of his trust in you!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "text": "None of us have the power to choose.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "........",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "text": "You'll do it for him. Everything.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "text": "Or would you rather watch him die?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "Don't you realize what happened? After passing through that village, Talulah changed completely! She's not the same person!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "text": "I know.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "Then why are you doing this?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "text": "I don't trust anyone but you and her.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "text": "And I don't want to choose.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "........",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "text": "Faust, where are we going?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "........I........",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "text": "Faust, tell me. What should we do?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "......We survive.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "text": "Isn't it painful to be alive?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "It's painful.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "But we can do it together.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "This book, it's a book about ideals.\nMy ideals are...."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
